# Tenant Isolation

Mandatory:
- tenant context explicit at application boundaries
- persistence queries enforce tenant scope for tenant-owned data
- caches/keys/channels prevent cross-tenant leakage
- integration calls include tenant-safe scoping/credentials where applicable

Review expectations:
- sensitive paths include tenant-boundary tests
- cross-tenant data exposure is always critical severity
- fallback/error paths must preserve tenant boundaries
